{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI have reached Kassel, arriving just after eleven. The morning was warm, so I spent it wandering the streets and the gardens, letting my thoughts settle after the journey. The town is pleasant enough, though it lacks the bustle of Berlin. I sat in a quiet corner of the Hofgarten for some time, watching the light change, and found myself reflecting on the peculiar stillness of provincial life here. It is a sharp contrast to the intellectual ferment we know at home.\n\nI hope the boys are well-behaved and that your health is steady. I miss our evenings and the comfort of our library. I shall try to rest well tonight, for we must continue our route tomorrow. Do not worry; the roads are good, and I am in high spirits. Give my love to Karl and Immanuel, and tell them their father is thinking of them as he watches the stars come out over the palace.\n\nYours ever,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795080147,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":203,"prompt_tokens":915,"total_tokens":1118,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-fIE9qvvYG9AgwOOg1TCPZpp1kfUHavKO","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":915,"prompt_ms":908.128,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9924896174863388,"prompt_per_second":1007.5672151943338,"predicted_n":203,"predicted_ms":4794.45,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.73490099009901,"predicted_per_second":42.13204851442814}}